request.description:
Input (raw JSON): { "message": "<free-text change request>" }

Feeds the current version's files + the message to OpenAI, asks for only the modified files, and creates a NEW GenerationVersion (parentVersion = old version, versionNumber + 1) with the resulting GeneratedFile rows.

Both the incoming message and the assembled prompt are checked by PromptSecurityService (prompt-injection guard) before being sent to OpenAI; the AI response is checked by AiResponseValidator and SensitiveDataValidator before being stored.
